{"translation":{"id":"ory_irv","name":"ଇଣ୍ଡିୟାନ ରିୱାଇସ୍ଡ୍ ୱରସନ୍ ଓଡିଆ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=ory","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=ory","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"IRV","englishName":"Oriya Indian Revised Version Bible","language":"ory","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"fe09301e6f43dbbcfcb30753438997976ee983751a3278733f551d91025dee13","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31104,"languageName":"ଓଡ଼ିଆ","languageEnglishName":"Odia"},"book":{"id":"JOB","translationId":"ory_irv","name":"ଆୟୁବ","commonName":"ଆୟୁବ","title":"ଆୟୁବ ପୁସ୍ତକ","order":18,"numberOfChapters":42,"sha256":"a4fc2ec7e450cfd7f9bff7c7839e3100ebd4d0d7bb39fb65ddfab03c94a5a580","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/JOB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":42,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/JOB/42.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1070},"chapter":{"number":25,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ବିଲ୍‍ଦଦ୍‍-ମନୁଷ୍ୟ ପକ୍ଷେ ଧାର୍ମିକ ଓ ଶୁଚି ଅସମ୍ଭବ"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["ଏଥିରେ ଶୂହୀୟ ବିଲ୍‍ଦଦ୍‍ ଉତ୍ତର କରି କହିଲା,"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"“ପ୍ରଭୁତ୍ୱ ଓ ଭୟ ତାହାଙ୍କଠାରେ ଥାଏ;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ସେ ଆପଣା ଉଚ୍ଚସ୍ଥାନରେ ଶାନ୍ତି ସମ୍ପାଦନ କରନ୍ତି।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ତାହାଙ୍କ ସୈନ୍ୟଦଳର କି କୌଣସି ସଂଖ୍ୟା ଅଛି?","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"କାହା ଉପରେ ତାହାଙ୍କ ଦୀପ୍ତି ଉଦିତ ନ ହୁଏ?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ତେବେ ମନୁଷ୍ୟ କିପରି ପରମେଶ୍ୱରଙ୍କ ଛାମୁରେ ଧାର୍ମିକ ହୋଇ ପାରିବ?","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ଅବା ସ୍ତ୍ରୀଜାତ ଲୋକ କିପରି ଶୁଚି ହୋଇ ପାରିବ?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ଦେଖ, ତାହାଙ୍କ ଦୃଷ୍ଟିରେ ଚନ୍ଦ୍ର ହିଁ ନିସ୍ତେଜ ଅଟେ","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ଓ ତାରାଗଣ ନିର୍ମଳ ନୁହନ୍ତି;","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ତେବେ କୀଟମାତ୍ର ମନୁଷ୍ୟ କʼଣ!","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ଓ କୃମିମାତ୍ର ମନୁଷ୍ୟ-ସନ୍ତାନ କʼଣ?”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/ory_irv/JOB/25.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/JOB/26.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/JOB/24.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}